  alt="Session detail showing the exact selected capture and preview"
  width={1440}
  height={900}
  caption="A capture reference selects a visible point in the session. This is an isolated synthetic session, captured from the implemented Dashcam UI."
/>

### Watch the return path

The light and dark films show the same implemented flow with on-screen
annotations. Choose the version that matches your reading theme and press play;
the films are paused by default so narration remains available. Both include
English captions and an embedded subtitle track.

