The films use Cartesia Sonic 3.6 narration (Clive — Measured Expert),
Remotion animation, and editorial caption timing. The shown session is a
**synthetic fixture**, not a customer recording. Screenshots come from the
product UI in both themes; the illustrations and annotations explain the
release behavior. Capture recording remains conditional on a configured
Playwright browser, and general video recording is still deferred.
